### 1. Get Vendor Payments KPI Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/vendor/payments/kpi/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. List Vendor Payments (Paginated with Filters & Search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/vendor/payments/?status=completed&search=Mediora
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Record Vendor Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/vendor/payments/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor": 1,
  "bill": 1,
  "payment_date": "2026-04-28",
  "payment_type": "full_payment",
  "payment_method": "bank_transfer",
  "amount_paid": "250000.00",
  "reference_number": "TRF-987654",
  "notes": "Full payment for purchase bill INV 0123",
  "status": "completed"
}

###

### 4. Get Vendor Payment Detail by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/vendor/payments/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Update Vendor Payment (Full PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/vendor/payments/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor": 1,
  "bill": 1,
  "payment_date": "2026-04-28",
  "payment_type": "partial_payment",
  "payment_method": "cheque",
  "amount_paid": "100000.00",
  "reference_number": "CHQ-123456",
  "notes": "Revised payment amount",
  "status": "completed"
}

###

### 6. Update Vendor Payment Status (Partial PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/vendor/payments/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "cancelled"
}

###

### 7. Export Vendor Payments CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/vendor/payments/export/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. Delete Vendor Payment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/vendor/payments/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
